; "HEROES.EXE" and exports AppAbout (ordinal 1, 0x0045c15c) and AppWndProc
; (ordinal 2, 0x0045bb45) by their undecorated names; the optional header
; reserves 0x10240 bytes of stack and commits 0x1000.
NAME HEROES
